# CampusQuest test-build copy

Follow `AGENTS.md` and the current README handoff section.
This repository is a separate test-build copy, not the production checkout.
Never treat a GitHub push as deployment permission. Do not relink the original
Vercel project, deploy, enable real payments or send messages without approval.
Automatic Vercel Git deployments are disabled in this copy's `vercel.json`.
Keep all secrets and real student data out of Git.
